@startuml

hide footbox

title US001 - To register a user in the system

box #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":RegisterUserController" as RegisterUserController
participant ":UserRepository" as UserRepository

' Human contact between Administrator and UI
Administrator -> UI : **1** I want to register a user in the system
UI -->> Administrator : **2** Provide username, contact and profile information for the User
Administrator -> UI : **3** For the new user (u1), here's the username, contact and profile information

' First contact between UI and the System
UI -> RegisterUserController : **4** RegisterUser(username, contact, profile)
activate RegisterUserController

RegisterUserController -> UserRepository : **5** createAndAddUser(username, contact, profile)
activate UserRepository
' Creation of u1 instance from User class
create "u1: User" as User


' Creation, validation and addition
UserRepository -> User : **6** create(username, contact, profile)
UserRepository -> UserRepository : **7** validateUser(u1)
UserRepository -> UserRepository : **8** addUserToUserList(u1)


' Return from UserRepository to RegisterUserController
UserRepository --> RegisterUserController : **9** New User (u1) created and added to the list of users
deactivate UserRepository

' Return from RegisterUserController to UI
RegisterUserController --> UI : **10** Success
deactivate RegisterUserController

' Return from UI to Administrator
UI --> Administrator : **11** Success

@enduml